OL,3,CFuneral for Oscar-winning actress
OL,4,CBrenda Fricker to be held in Dublin
OL,6,FThe funeral of Oscar-winning Irish
OL,7,Factress Brenda Fricker is to be held
OL,8,Fin a Dublin church on Thursday.
OL,10,FFricker, 81, died in Our Lady's
OL,11,FHospice in Dublin's Harold's Cross on
OL,12,FJuly 16 after a period of ill-health.
OL,14,FHer funeral is to be held at St
OL,15,FCatherine's Church in the Liberties,
OL,16,Fthe Dublin neighbourhood where she
OL,17,Fgrew up, at 11am on Thursday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/5
