OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785989891
OL,3,CFuneral for Oscar-winning actress
OL,4,CBrenda Fricker to be held in Dublin
OL,6,FFricker won a best supporting actress
OL,7,FOscar for her performance as Bridget
OL,8,FFagan Brown in 1989's My Left Foot,
OL,9,Fwhich tells the story of an Irishman
OL,10,Fnamed Christy Brown, played by Daniel
OL,11,FDay-Lewis, who was born with cerebral
OL,12,Fpalsy and could control only his left
OL,13,Ffoot.
OL,15,FFricker was also known for her role in
OL,16,Fthe 1992 follow-up to Home Alone,
OL,17,Fwhere she played Pigeon Lady, a
OL,18,Fhomeless woman in New York's Central
OL,19,FPark.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/5
