PN,30303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785989891
OL,3,CFuneral for Oscar-winning actress
OL,4,CBrenda Fricker to be held in Dublin
OL,6,FShe was also part of the original cast
OL,7,Fof BBC medical drama Casualty and
OL,8,Ffeatured alongside Cate Blanchett in
OL,9,FVeronica Guerin (2003), as well as
OL,10,Fappearing in ITV drama Upstairs,
OL,11,FDownstairs and soap opera Coronation
OL,12,FStreet.
OL,14,FHer other film appearances included So
OL,15,FI Married An Axe Murderer (1993),
OL,16,FAngels In The Outfield (1994) and A
OL,17,FTime To Kill (1996).
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/5
