PN,30304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785989891
OL,3,CFuneral for Oscar-winning actress
OL,4,CBrenda Fricker to be held in Dublin
OL,6,FHer later roles included the TV
OL,7,Fadaptation of Graham Norton's first
OL,8,Fnovel Holding, directed by Kathy
OL,9,FBurke, and the Channel 5 drama series
OL,10,FThe Catch.
OL,12,FFricker also made numerous stage
OL,13,Fappearances in plays such as Lavender
OL,14,FBlue and A Pagan's Place at theatres
OL,15,Fincluding the National Theatre and
OL,16,FRoyal Court Theatre.
OL,18,FHer agent Phil Belfield described the
OL,19,FIrish actress as a "legend" whom he
OL,20,Fwas "honoured to know".
