PN,30305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785989892
OL,3,CFuneral for Oscar-winning actress
OL,4,CBrenda Fricker to be held in Dublin
OL,6,F"Dublin-born and bred, Brenda Fricker
OL,7,Fundoubtedly deserves the noun legend,"
OL,8,Fhe said.
OL,10,F"We will never see her like again and
OL,11,Fthe world is lesser for the lack of
OL,12,Fher. I was honoured to know, love and
OL,13,Fwork with her, and she will always
OL,14,Fhave a place in my heart and in the
OL,15,Fheart of so many film and TV fans the
OL,16,Fworld over."
